, la tríada de Type O Negative (Slow Deep And Hard, misas negras wagnerianas), Today Is The Day y Fear Factory; Biohazard, Coalesce, Dillinger Escape Plan. El nuevo black metal escandinavo: Entombed, Darkthrone, Immortal, Mayhem, Enslaved, Emperor, Satyricon, Cradle Of Filth.","color":"#f87171","family":"Hard rock, metal y grunge","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#metal-90s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":243240975567338,"artist":"Extreme","artist_id":232984352168726,"title":"Pornograffiti","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"OVwEKr38MzQ","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Metal de los noventa: progresivo, death y black metal","scene_id":1220976824039,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#metal-90s","chapters":["Sección 6.16"],"pages":[[1,286,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":300,"text":"…& Carl: Drawing Of Sound (Icon) 35. For Carnation: Marshmallows (Matador) 36. Labradford: Labradford (Kranky) 37. Shinjuku Thief: Bloody Tourist (Extreme) 38. Motherhead Bug: Zambodia (Pow Wow) 39. Kenneth Newby: Ecology Of Souls (Songlines) 40. Sugarsmack: Top Loader (Invisible) 41. Unwound: Fake…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":301,"text":"…To Spill: Perfect From Now On (Warner) 62. Pram: Helium (Too Pure, 1994) 63. Doldrums: Acupuncture (Kranky) 64. Vidna Obmana: Spiritual Bonding (Extreme) 65. Air Liquide: The Increased Difficulty Of Concentration (Smile) 66. Low: Long Division (Vernon Yard) 67. Six Finger Satellite: The Pigeon Is The…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":135277695687524,"type":"album","name":"II Pornograffitti","list_id":221108802372907,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Funk Metal","src":"musthear","rank":18,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"OVwEKr38MzQ","scaruffi":null},{"id":135277695687524,"type":"album","na